{
  "map": "UndeadRE02",
  "title": "Blackrock Encampment",
  "locale": "zhCN",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "兽人。多年以来，他们一直是这片土地上的污点。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 39,
        "speaker_string_id": 40,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T010-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "并非所有兽人都是这样。不过黑石氏族的劫掠者是以残暴闻名的。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 319,
        "speaker_string_id": 320,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T020-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "那我们就去“劝劝”他们别再劫掠被遗忘者了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 317,
        "speaker_string_id": 318,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T030-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "任务完成了。希望其他兽人能够听从这次警告。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 53,
        "speaker_string_id": 54,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T040-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "莱尼德，你说并非所有兽人都会对这片土地造成威胁。你遇见过其他兽人吗？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 57,
        "speaker_string_id": 58,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T050-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "是啊，在银色黎明时。我听说一名年轻的大酋长率领许多兽人渡海离开了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 335,
        "speaker_string_id": 336,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T060-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "莱尼德",
      "text": "据说他正在打造一个重视力量和荣誉的“新部落”。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 325,
        "speaker_string_id": 326,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T061-LEONID"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "除非亲眼看见，否则我绝不相信。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 71,
        "speaker_string_id": 72,
        "dialogue_id": "A2M3-T070-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "尼科洛",
      "text": "尝尝我的利刃！",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 341,
        "speaker_string_id": 342,
        "dialogue_id": "HeroBladeMasterYesAttack3"
      }
    }
  ]
}